{"id":"54f6107246f40c19","group":"91","path":"91/91-lem-truth-predicate-undefinability.md","title":"一致算术理论不能内部证明全真理模式","display":"lem-truth-predicate-undefinability — 一致算术理论不能内部证明全真理模式","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-lem-truth-predicate-undefinability","aliases":["91-lem-truth-predicate-undefinability","91-lem-Tarski-lemma","91-lem-truth-not-definable"],"display":"lem-truth-predicate-undefinability — 一致算术理论不能内部证明全真理模式","depends_on":["[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]","[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","[[91-df-ground-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-lem-truth-predicate-undefinability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-lem-truth-predicate-undefinability</span><span>91-lem-Tarski-lemma</span><span>91-lem-truth-not-definable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-truth-predicate-undefinability — 一致算术理论不能内部证明全真理模式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c289f1c721012496\" href=\"?note=c289f1c721012496\" title=\"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability\">91-thm-Tarski-undefinability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" href=\"?note=41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" title=\"91-thm-diagonal-lemma\">91-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> (采用经典逻辑的算术理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm Q\\subseteq\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathrm Q\\subseteq\\mathcal S\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 包含足够的对角化算术)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 为固定算术矛盾句，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal S)\n\\coloneqq\\mathcal S\\nvdash\\bot\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal S)\n\\coloneqq\\mathcal S\\nvdash\\bot\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x),\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x),\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>\n(至多以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 为自由变量的基础语言公式与句子)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Diag}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\theta(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\;\n\\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;\n[\\mathcal S\\vdash\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\theta(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})]\">\\(\\operatorname{Diag}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\theta(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\;\n\\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;\n[\\mathcal S\\vdash\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\theta(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})]\\)</span>；\n这是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" href=\"?note=41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" title=\"91-thm-diagonal-lemma\">91-thm-diagonal-lemma</a> 在基础语言中的固定点性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}undefinability}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm Q\\subseteq\\mathcal S\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal S)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Diag}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\neg\\exists\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\,\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}undefinability}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm Q\\subseteq\\mathcal S\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal S)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Diag}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\neg\\exists\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\,\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若存在这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>，对基础语言公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\tau(x)\">\\(\\neg\\tau(x)\\)</span> 应用所声明的性质，\n得到仍属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 及\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span>。把\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi=\\lambda\">\\(\\varphi=\\lambda\\)</span> 代入假定的全双条件，得到\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span>，\n与一致性冲突。</p>\n<p>这一区分很重要：基础语言可以对每个固定复杂度类定义部分真理谓词，\n也能定义语法满足关系的有限片段；它不能由一个基础语言公式在一致理论\n内部统一证明所有基础句的真理双条件。语义版 Tarski 定理则表述为标准\n模型的全部算术真句集合不可由单个算术公式定义。</p>\n<p>来源：§6 的对角方法及上述句法证明。此处的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span>\n与基础语言量化均在元层；未使用一个未展开的“满足对角引理”谓词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability","status":"resolved","id":"c289f1c721012496","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"41fdad0bfaff0bf5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"41fdad0bfaff0bf5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Diag}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\theta(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\;\n\\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;\n[\\mathcal S\\vdash\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\theta(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})]$；\n这是 [[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]] 在基础语言中的固定点性质。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm Q\\subseteq\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal S)\n\\coloneqq\\mathcal S\\nvdash\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x),\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Diag}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\theta(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\;\n\\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;\n[\\mathcal S\\vdash\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\theta(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}undefinability}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm Q\\subseteq\\mathcal S\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal S)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Diag}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\neg\\exists\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\,\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\tau(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi=\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false}],"bytes":2718,"backlinks":[{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-truth-predicate-undefinability]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-truth-predicate-undefinability]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-178","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-truth-predicate-undefinability]]"}],"outgoing":["c289f1c721012496","41fdad0bfaff0bf5","2ad7561edabb2148"]}